      "side": 1,
      "message": "I thought about it but since we touch both:\n```\narch/x86/kvm/pkvm/pkvm.c \narch/x86/kvm/x86.c \n```\n\nI\u0027ve decided to go with more generic `KVM: x86:`\nDoes that make sense for you?",
